| `canary.step_timeout_minutes` | integer | `90` | a whole number of minutes, 1 or more | `scripts/canary.py` | Sets how long one canary step (a render, an update, a commit, an install or a verify) may run before its process group is killed and the step fails. Read only in the template repository; absent, the canary writes `[using default] canary.step_timeout_minutes = 90` to stderr. | the farm job's time limit: `launcher.long_scripts.<name>.minutes` | always |
